ill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>The <em>Tainted Cup</em> meets <em>Fallen London</em> in this steampunk horror management game. As the operator of Wall Station 1, the player handles resource allocation and the flow of information to other nearby settlements in order to survive the nightly onslaught of giant ghouls.</p>\r\n<p>Meet and interact with your fellow operators over radiotelegraph. Choose to collaborate or not, your choices matter in the face of certain destruction. The lives of your people hang in the balance.</p>\r\n<h3>Instructions</h3>\r\n<p>Allocate your&nbsp;resources to&nbsp;tasks by dragging and dropping in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Management&nbsp;view.&nbsp;Look&nbsp;into&nbsp;information&nbsp;on the&nbsp;night&#x27;s&nbsp;attack&nbsp;by sending your&nbsp;workforce&nbsp;to&nbsp;investigate&nbsp;and&nbsp;checking&nbsp;the&nbsp;Ghouls&nbsp;view. Discuss information&nbsp;and&nbsp;make&nbsp;connections&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Comms&nbsp;view.</p>\r\n<p>Will&nbsp;you&nbsp;focus&nbsp;your&nbsp;efforts&nbsp;on&nbsp;surviving&nbsp;longer&nbsp;or&nbsp;making the most of time&nbsp;you&nbsp;survive?<br></p>\r\n<h3>Credits</h3>\r\n<h4>Team Not Cozy</h4>\r\n<p><strong>Coding</strong> - Mohammed Khadadeh, Vick Lim</p>\r\n<p><strong>Writing </strong>- Mohammed Khadadeh</p>\r\n<p><strong>Art</strong> - Isabel Wu</p>\r\n<p><strong>Sound Design and Composing</strong> - Mia Wang</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20